WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.608
Shi Jingtang put on his armor and accepted the Khitan's support.

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:08.198
He ceded the Sixteen Prefectures of Yan and Yun to the Khitan.

00:00:08.548 --> 00:00:13.804
On the map, the great stretch of northern land changed color.

00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:17.874
The Khitan banners fluttered in the wind over the grassland.

00:00:18.224 --> 00:00:22.568
The high mountains and the Great Wall were natural strategic passes.

00:00:22.918 --> 00:00:26.566
Having lost the strategic passes, the Central Plains had no barrier left.

00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:31.956
Many years later, the Song emperor gazed north and sighed.

00:00:32.306 --> 00:00:35.690
Their wish was to recover this land.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.688
The border soldiers stood guard on the city walls day and night.

00:00:40.038 --> 00:00:43.422
As the cold wind blew past, they gripped their weapons tightly.

00:00:43.772 --> 00:00:49.124
Under the setting sun, the map tells this story of the past.

00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:54.034
The Sixteen Prefectures of Yan and Yun became a regret lasting four hundred years.

